  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "日本人文與地理",
    "sub_ename": "THE HUMAN GEOGRAPHY OF JAPAN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的乃為促成學生全面瞭解日本各地的人文歷史與區域特色，同時又介紹日本地理以及各別地方的產業，以便學生確實對日本人文與地理獲得概括性的深入認識。\n1.日本的人文地理(行政區域的劃分、人口、空港與海港)\n2.日本的自然地理(海洋地理位置、國土與國境、自然災害)\n3.日本各地方的概況與特色\n4.日本的自然公園與文化歷史的資源(世界遺產、國家公園、各地文化財)",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to provide students with a comprehensive understanding of the human history and regional characteristics of Japan, as well as an introduction to the geography of Japan and the industries of each region.\n1. The human geography of Japan (administrative division, population, airlines and sea ports)\n2. The natural geography of Japan (geographical position, land and territory, natural disasters)\n3. The common phenomenon and specific characteristics of each region in Japan\n4. The potential natural and cultural in Japan (world heritage, national parks, etc.)",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解日本各地方的產業及特色。",
      "describe_en": "To realize the industries and characteristics of each region in Japan."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "探討日本人文地理及各地方的風俗。",
      "describe_en": "Explore human and cultural geography and traditions of Japan."
    }
